  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you make a weapon attack that lets you add your proficiency bonus to the attack roll, you can choose to temporarily infuse the weapon with haki. You add a d4 to the damage roll, and the weapon is considered haki-imbued for the purpose of overcoming resistances and immunities. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and regain all uses when you finish a short or long rest.</p>",
